    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "secA_evid", "x": 620, "y": 320, "width": 480, "height": 236,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 20051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20052, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secA_evid_t", "x": 638, "y": 336, "width": 445, "height": 170,
      "text": "delta_c(z) = delta_c0 / Dg(z)\ndelta_c0 = (3/5)(3 pi/2)^(2/3)\n\nnu^2 = delta_c(z)^2 / S ,  S = sigma(M)^2\n\npFC(delta,S) = A (1+(q nu^2)^-p) *\n   sqrt(q nu^2/2pi) exp(-q nu^2/2) / S\n(p, q) = (0.3, 0.8)   [ellipsoidal collapse]\n\ndn/dlnM = -rho_M0 * pFC(delta_c,sigma^2)\n            * 2 sigma dsigma/dM",
      "originalText": "delta_c(z) = delta_c0 / Dg(z)\ndelta_c0 = (3/5)(3 pi/2)^(2/3)\n\nnu^2 = delta_c(z)^2 / S ,  S = sigma(M)^2\n\npFC(delta,S) = A (1+(q nu^2)^-p) *\n   sqrt(q nu^2/2pi) exp(-q nu^2/2) / S\n(p, q) = (0.3, 0.8)   [ellipsoidal collapse]\n\ndn/dlnM = -rho_M0 * pFC(delta_c,sigma^2)\n            * 2 sigma dsigma/dM",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
