    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "secB_evid", "x": 480, "y": 700, "width": 430, "height": 220,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 21051, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 21052, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secB_evid_t", "x": 498, "y": 716, "width": 396, "height": 190,
      "text": "barN(z,M) = c*pi*((1+zl)*r_max)^2 / H(zl)\n              * (dn/dlnM) * dlnM * dz\n\ncell modulation:  N -> lambda * barN\n  lambda = exp(delta_b - sigma_b^2/2)   (legacy iid)\n  lambda = exp(b*Dg*field - <.>)        (correlated 1D)\n\nper realization j:\n  if lambda*barN < 0.2: Bernoulli draw\n  else: N_j ~ Poisson(lambda * barN)",
      "originalText": "barN(z,M) = c*pi*((1+zl)*r_max)^2 / H(zl)\n              * (dn/dlnM) * dlnM * dz\n\ncell modulation:  N -> lambda * barN\n  lambda = exp(delta_b - sigma_b^2/2)   (legacy iid)\n  lambda = exp(b*Dg*field - <.>)        (correlated 1D)\n\nper realization j:\n  if lambda*barN < 0.2: Bernoulli draw\n  else: N_j ~ Poisson(lambda * barN)",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 21053, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 21054, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.35 },

