    { "type": "text", "id": "secC_evid_t", "x": 80, "y": 1316, "width": 1010, "height": 180,
      "text": "c = 10^(a + b log10(M / (1e12/h)))   a = 0.520+(0.905-0.520) exp(-0.617 z^1.21)   b = -0.101+0.026 z\n\nr200 = (3M / (4 pi 200 rho(z)))^(1/3)   rs = r200 / c   rho_s = 200 rho(z) c^3 (1+c) / [3((1+c)ln(1+c)-c)]\n\nkappa0 = rs rho_s / Sigma_cr    kappa_NFW(x) = 2 kappa0 Fg(x)   x = r/rs   [Fg: astro-ph/0608153, x<1/x>1/x=1 cases]\n\nepsilon(M,z) = max(0, (1-s)/(1+s)),  s = 0.54 (M / M_char(z))^-0.05   [pseudo-elliptical fit, astro-ph/0508497]",
      "originalText": "c = 10^(a + b log10(M / (1e12/h)))   a = 0.520+(0.905-0.520) exp(-0.617 z^1.21)   b = -0.101+0.026 z\n\nr200 = (3M / (4 pi 200 rho(z)))^(1/3)   rs = r200 / c   rho_s = 200 rho(z) c^3 (1+c) / [3((1+c)ln(1+c)-c)]\n\nkappa0 = rs rho_s / Sigma_cr    kappa_NFW(x) = 2 kappa0 Fg(x)   x = r/rs   [Fg: astro-ph/0608153, x<1/x>1/x=1 cases]\n\nepsilon(M,z) = max(0, (1-s)/(1+s)),  s = 0.54 (M / M_char(z))^-0.05   [pseudo-elliptical fit, astro-ph/0508497]",
