    { "type": "text", "id": "secD_norm_t", "x": 720, "y": 2295, "width": 550, "height": 110,
      "text": "normalization (JvdB14 eq. 23):\nf_s = gamma~/(omega beta^s) [Gamma(s,beta psi_res^w)-Gamma(s,beta)]\ns=(1+alpha)/omega,  psi_res=1e-4 (sim. calibration point)", "originalText": "normalization (JvdB14 eq. 23):\nf_s = gamma~/(omega beta^s) [Gamma(s,beta psi_res^w)-Gamma(s,beta)]\ns=(1+alpha)/omega,  psi_res=1e-4 (sim. calibration point)",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle",
