    { "type": "ellipse", "id": "secF_d1", "x": 90, "y": 3064, "width": 12, "height": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#3b82f6", "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 25021, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 25022, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secF_d1_t", "x": 120, "y": 3050, "width": 340, "height": 40,
      "text": "psi_lo(r)  —  dynamic resolved floor,\nkeyed to host-center distance r", "originalText": "psi_lo(r)  —  dynamic resolved floor,\nkeyed to host-center distance r",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 25023, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 25024, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.3 },
    { "type": "ellipse", "id": "secF_d2", "x": 90, "y": 3174, "width": 12, "height": 12,
      "strokeColor": "#3b82f6", "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 25031, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 25032, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secF_d2_t", "x": 120, "y": 3160, "width": 340, "height": 40,
      "text": "N_res(r)  —  expected resolved\nclump count for this sightline", "originalText": "N_res(r)  —  expected resolved\nclump count for this sightline",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 25033, "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 25034, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.3 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "secF_evid", "x": 500, "y": 3040, "width": 500, "height": 250,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 25041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 25042, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "secF_evid_t", "x": 518, "y": 3056, "width": 464, "height": 220,
      "text": "psi_lo(r) = max(Mmin, m(r_thr = r)) / M\n  (subhalo_brute: psi_lo = m_floor / M instead)\n\nN_res = (gamma~/alpha) (psi_max^alpha - psi_lo^alpha)\nN_c ~ Poisson(N_res)\n\nper clump (k = 1..N_c):\n  psi ~ inverse-CDF power law on [psi_lo,psi_max],\n    thinned by exp(-beta psi^omega)  [exact SHMF,\n    Poisson-thinning theorem]\n  3D position: invRad (Sec. E) + isotropic angles\n  project to 2D -> distance d to the ray",
      "originalText": "psi_lo(r) = max(Mmin, m(r_thr = r)) / M\n  (subhalo_brute: psi_lo = m_floor / M instead)\n\nN_res = (gamma~/alpha) (psi_max^alpha - psi_lo^alpha)\nN_c ~ Poisson(N_res)\n\nper clump (k = 1..N_c):\n  psi ~ inverse-CDF power law on [psi_lo,psi_max],\n    thinned by exp(-beta psi^omega)  [exact SHMF,\n    Poisson-thinning theorem]\n  3D position: invRad (Sec. E) + isotropic angles\n  project to 2D -> distance d to the ray",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 25043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 25044, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "lineHeight": 1.45 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "secF_host", "x": 1060, "y": 3110, "width": 180, "height": 80,
