    { "type": "text", "id": "secH_evid_t", "x": 398, "y": 4136, "width": 524, "height": 140,
      "text": "Campbell moments of the Poisson clump field (mean +\nintensity-weighted mean square, no mean subtracted):\n\nmu_u(r)   = int dlnpsi dN/dlnpsi  int d^2R Sig2D(R) kappa_NFW(|r-R|; psi M)\nsigma_u^2(r) = int dlnpsi dN/dlnpsi  int d^2R Sig2D(R) kappa_NFW(|r-R|; psi M)^2",
      "originalText": "Campbell moments of the Poisson clump field (mean +\nintensity-weighted mean square, no mean subtracted):\n\nmu_u(r)   = int dlnpsi dN/dlnpsi  int d^2R Sig2D(R) kappa_NFW(|r-R|; psi M)\nsigma_u^2(r) = int dlnpsi dN/dlnpsi  int d^2R Sig2D(R) kappa_NFW(|r-R|; psi M)^2",
